This project reproduces no exact card art, logos, or trademarked title
treatment from the original physical game beyond the Party Membership
sigils (dove-in-laurel for Liberal, skull-and-snake for Fascist), which are
sourced and re-colored from the official print-and-play kit under the
terms above — see process_sigils.py for how they were derived.
